  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"">Deprecated: </p>
      <p>  <p>Suppress default collision sprites, replace default impact sprite with <b>impact_sprite</b></p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string|uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>ImpactSprite / impact_sprite</td>
          <td>a texture in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a> of the prim this script is in, a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a>&#32;of a texture&#32;or an empty string</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>effects</li>
        <li>sound</li>
